keiko 1
# T3 (distinct autosave and manual parks), the fresh-launch half — a relaunch
# has no live session, so Continue describes and loads the autosave, not the
# manual Slot 1 that holds a different park.
# Excluded: the process restart itself (the take starts from the kept sidecar
# bytes), the Continue line's rendered scene/time, unusable-autosave bytes
# preservation (t3b covers the disabled row; file equality is a rule test).
fixture autosave fixtures/autosave-reunion.ron
fixture slot-1 fixtures/slot-first.ron
setting play.text_speed 0

expect surface title
expect slot 1 scene first_meeting
expect slot autosave scene reunion
activate title.continue
expect surface play
expect scene reunion
expect line "The gate again, hours later. She's still there."
expect slot 1 scene first_meeting
